	)
	(text
		"DESIGN NOTES\nLIS3DH on VDD_EXT 1.8 V, I2C 0x18, INT1 -> GPIO2: wake-on-motion, tow / theft and fall alerts.\nIgnition: 47k/10k into Q5, IGN_DET_N active low on GPIO1 (wake-capable). Survives 0-60 V and reverse.\nRelay output: Q6 low-side driver for an immobiliser relay coil, flyback D6 to VIN_PROT.\nLEDs: green = modem on (STATUS), yellow = network (NET_STATUS), red = charging (MCP73831 STAT)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b7c2bfd3-3719-5645-b2c8-5ac17926a470")
	)
	(text
		"PART NOTES (VERIFY = check against vendor datasheet before release)\nU7: Runs from VDD_EXT 1.8 V, no level shifting\nR34: SDO/SA0 low -> I2C address 0x18\nR24: IGN > ~3.5 V reads as ON\nQ6: Gate from 1.8 V GPIO: Rds(on) ~0.1 R at 1.8 V - VERIFY for the coil current"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219.71 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bcd6d33e-47ab-538c-b0b6-e48378190388")
	)
)
